{"type":"agent_end","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"","sections":{"preamble":"You are a coding assistant running inside pi, a coding agent harness. Help users inspect files, run commands, and modify code.","tools":"<tools>\n- read: Read file contents\n- bash: Execute bash commands (ls, grep, find, etc.)\n- edit: Make precise file edits with exact text replacement, including multiple disjoint edits in one call\n- write: Create or overwrite files\n\nAdditional tools may be available.\n</tools>","rules":"<rules>\n- Use bash for file operations like ls, rg, find\n- Use read to examine files instead of cat or sed.\n- You can inspect PI_* environment variables for current model and session details.\n- Use edit for targeted changes. Batch changes to one file in a single call.\n- Each edits[].oldText must exactly and uniquely match the original file. Keep matches short and non-overlapping; merge nearby changes without including large unchanged regions.\n- Use write only for new files or complete rewrites.\n- Be concise in your responses\n- Show file paths clearly when working with files\n</rules>","docs":"<docs>\nPi documentation (read only when the user asks about the harness itself, its SDK, extensions, themes, skills, or TUI):\n- Main documentation: /home/ubuntu/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/README.md\n- Additional docs: /home/ubuntu/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/docs\n- Examples: /home/ubuntu/.npm-global/lib/node_modules/@earendil-works/pi-coding-agent/examples (extensions, custom tools, SDK)\n- When reading pi docs or examples, resolve docs/... under Additional docs and examples/... under Examples, not the current working directory\n- When asked about: extensions (docs/extensions.md, examples/extensions/), themes (docs/themes.md), skills (docs/skills.md), prompt templates (docs/prompt-templates.md), TUI components (docs/tui.md), keybindings (docs/keybindings.md), SDK integrations (docs/sdk.md), custom providers (docs/custom-provider.md), adding models (docs/models.md), packages (docs/packages.md), environment variables (docs/environment-variables.md), MCP servers (docs/mcp.md), codemode scripts and non-LLM models such as classifiers and image models (docs/codemode.md)\n- Before implementing harness changes, read the relevant docs and examples in full, following related cross-references.\n</docs>","project_context":"<project_context>\nProject-specific instructions and guidelines:\n\n<project_instructions path=\"/home/ubuntu/dev/relay/AGENTS.md\">\n# Relay 仓库治理规则\n\n状态：**FROZEN**。仅针对本仓库开发，不代表已实现的产品功能。\n\n1. **权威顺序**：以 live GitHub `main` 的代码、文档、测试及 CI 证据为准；聊天与记忆仅作导航。开始任务先读取 `README.md`、`CURRENT.md`、`ARCHITECTURE_BASELINE.md`、相关 ADR。\n2. **单写者**：单人项目，仅 `main` 为长期开发分支。任何工作开始前确认远端 HEAD、未解释的本地脏工作区/分叉和写者冲突；冲突时只读，不能擅自 reset、覆盖或强推。\n3. **权威归属**：Architecture/ADR 负责持久边界，Roadmap 负责里程碑，`CURRENT.md` 负责**唯一当前工作包**，Issue 用于任务跟踪，Evidence/REPORT 是结果证明。不要另造状态系统。\n4. **写入授权**：只有 CURRENT 标记为 ACTIVE 且写者、范围、验收及安全条件明确时，Agent 才可以实施代码。架构与基线更新必须有用户明确授权。本轮授权仅设计文档。\n5. **开发安全**：每次变更先审计、确定边界再写；任何执行都不能绕过 Operator Policy；禁止强推、自动触碰生产凭据、不可逆操作；`main` 集成需检验预期 HEAD 与快进条件。\n6. **验证**：Agent 的 DONE 不是验收。必须有独立复核、可追溯的测试/观察证据与明确未验证项；不能把文档检查冒充运行时 E2E。\n7. **续接**：新执行窗口必须从 live `main` 冷启动，不得直接执行旧对话指令；完成后更新 `CURRENT.md` 和 `docs/CONTINUATION.md`，报告真实提交 SHA、CI/验证与风险。\n8. **扩展克制**：优先最小垂直切片；新增 Core 服务、抽象或强依赖须引用 ADR 和验证证据。所有正式文档使用中文。\n\n孤立开发可用临时 **detached** worktree；不得自动创建永久功能分支。未获授权时，不应默默安装、重配或升级宿主机服务。\n</project_instructions>\n</project_context>","cwd":"<cwd>\n/home/ubuntu/dev/relay/.p0-00-lab/ws/a0-work\n</cwd>"},"timestamp":1794229680640,"toolsAdded":[{"name":"read","description":"Read the contents of a file. Supports text files and images (jpg, png, gif, webp, bmp). Images are sent as attachments. For text files, output is truncated to 2000 lines or 50KB (whichever is hit first). Use offset/limit for large files. When you need the full file, continue with offset until complete.","parameters":{"type":"object